## Service Dependencies

### Gemini Vision API
- **Used by:** Both photo & video features
- **Input:** Image bytes (photo) or image bytes array (video frames)
- **Output:** Text analysis

### Google Cloud Storage
- **Operations:** WRITE images/videos, WRITE JSON results, APPEND logs
- **Path structure:** Date-based partitioning for performance

### MediaPipe Face Landmarker
- **Used by:** Real-time liveness detection (browser-side)
- **Input:** Video frames from camera
- **Output:** 468 facial landmarks

### External Integrations
- **localStorage:** Read base & terminal from crew profile
- **Camera API:** WebRTC MediaStream
- **File handling:** Canvas for photo capture, WebM codec for video

