## Error Handling

**Photo Assessment:**
- Invalid image → 400 error
- Gemini failure → Retry 3× with backoff
- GCS upload fail → Return 500
- Liveness check fail → User retakes photo

**Video Assessment:**
- Liveness detection fail → "Please blink to confirm presence"
- Video size > 20MB → 400 error
- Frame extraction fail → Return 500
- Gemini failure → Retry mechanism
- GCS upload fail → Return 500

