✅ **Multi-frame Analysis** - Video frames for comprehensive assessment
✅ **Structured Assessment** - 5 grooming categories scored
✅ **Persistent Storage** - All results in GCS with date partitioning
✅ **Crew History** - Append-only log for audit trail

